:: A3_Order [scene conversation]
<div class="scene-body">
<p class="lead">Room 412 · Friday, 23 August · 14:00</p>

Today Yeltsin signed a decree suspending the Communist Party's activity in Russia. <<note "cpsu-suspended">> A crowd has gathered outside on Staraya Ploshchad, and it keeps growing, chanting. Someone has painted something on the wall by Entrance 5 that you choose not to read.

Rudin comes into your office without knocking. His tie is gone. He is carrying an empty cardboard box.

<div class="speaker" data-who="rudin"><div class="speaker-portrait"></div><div><span class="speaker-name">Gennady Ivanovich Rudin</span><span class="speaker-role">Deputy head of sector</span></div></div>

<p class="say">All special correspondence goes to the shredder. All of it, Andrei Nikolaevich, in the next hour. Box twelve, the cipher drafts, your drawer. It is a <<ru "prikaz">>, an order.</p>

<p class="say">We did nothing wrong. But they will not see it that way.</p>

<<if $kept.includes("d4")>>Packet 7/С is in your drawer. Your briefcase is under the desk.<<else>>Packet 7/С is in box twelve, and box twelve is about to be emptied.<</if>>

<div class="choices"><<link "Slip Packet 7/С into your briefcase. Shred everything else.">><<run setup.addExposure(State.variables, 1); setup.setDoc(State.variables, "d4", "held"); State.variables.tray.delete("d4"); State.variables.kept.pushUnique("d4")>><<set $flags.finalDecision to "kept">><<set $time to "16:30">><<goto "A3_Exit">><</link>>
<<link "Feed Packet 7/С into the shredder yourself.">><<goto "Stub_Loyalist">><</link>><<if $flags.markovaContact>>
<<link "Phone Lena Markova and tell her you are coming with the file.">><<goto "Stub_Witness">><</link>><</if>></div>
</div>


:: A3_Exit [scene]
<div class="scene-body">
<p class="lead">Entrance 5 · 23 August · late afternoon</p>

Late in the afternoon the order comes: everyone out. The building is to be sealed. <<note "old-square-sealed">> Staff file down the stairs with their coats over their arms. Some are carrying bags they did not arrive with. Outside, the crowd parts for you, slowly and with contempt.

Your briefcase feels as heavy as a person. A policeman at the door looks at every face.

<<if setup.resolveEnding(State.variables) is "scapegoat">>He looks at yours for a long time. Then he looks at a list.

<div class="continue"><<link "Continue →">><<goto "Stub_Scapegoat">><</link>></div><<else>>He looks at yours, and then at the next one. The doors close behind you. Someone fixes a wax <<ru "pechat">>, a seal, across the handles. The sign on the door now reads <<ru "zakryto">>.

<div class="continue"><<link "December 1991 →">><<set $act to "epilogue">><<set $date to "25 ДЕК 1991">><<set $time to "19:30">><<goto "Epilogue_Survivor">><</link>></div><</if>>
</div>
